  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=5c2a21\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fobscure-tooltips-media-kit-VPpfjxP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Media Kit\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Get Media Kit-5c4521?style=for-the-badge&logo=imgur&labelColor=251C20&logoColor=white\"></a>\n</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Obscure Tooltips 是一款客户端视觉增强模组，它将普通的物品提示框转变为富有表现力、带有动画效果的展示窗口。通过引入流畅的动画、动态粒子效果以及适应物品稀有度和上下文的装饰性边框，为你的背包增添了沉浸式的视觉魅力。</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Rn2RuE.png\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BUUrpIP.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">动画提示框</h1>\n        <p>流畅的动画、发光边框和微妙的粒子效果让每一个提示框都栩栩如生。样式支持广泛的视觉修饰——从动态装饰到分层效果——使每一件物品都显得独特且富有表现力。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">集成模型</h1>\n        <p>在提示框内直接查看任何护甲、工具或武器的完整集成 3D 模型。无需装备或打开额外菜单即可即时预览装备。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nhHUKgM.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E9yChOe.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">平滑滚动</h1>\n        <p>当提示框内容超出屏幕高度时，自动平滑滚动功能激活，保持文本可读且不显杂乱。它让你能够自然地阅读长描述，而无需调整用户界面大小。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">智能换行</h1>\n        <p>智能换行功能保持宽提示框的整洁、易读和完美排版。长名称、背景故事和属性值保持对齐，不会溢出布局范围。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gUXvCIP.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4yIqabL.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">无限制的自定义</h1>\n        <p>Obscure Tooltips 是首个引入完全动画化、视觉丰富提示框的模组。虽然此后出现了类似的模组，但其模块化、数据驱动的设计仍然提供了一种独特的灵活方式，用于<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523tooltip-styles\" rel=\"nofollow\">构建</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523style-merging-fallback\" rel=\"nofollow\">合并样式</a>，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523tooltip-filters\" rel=\"nofollow\">创建条件</a>，以及<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523core-concept\" rel=\"nofollow\">自定义每个元素</a>以符合你的愿景。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<h2>游戏内配置</h2>\n<p>在 Minecraft 1.20.1 中，使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config Screens</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a> 模组时，可使用游戏内配置菜单。如果没有这些模组，所有设置仍可通过配置文件进行调整（<em>config/obscuria/obscure_tooltips-client.toml</em>）。从 Minecraft 1.21.1 开始，游戏内配置界面开箱即用，无需其他依赖项。</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZBaOT4.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AWVa1rL.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0F3Uyq.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillager-caravans\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lPK6BrB.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elixirum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zMZKr3b.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjJSLI0.png\" width=\"45%\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lV9g9R.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Y7y8mO.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>",
